# Risk & safety

- Live trading requires `LIVE_TRADING=true` AND `LIVE_TRADING_CONFIRM=I_UNDERSTAND_LIVE_RISK`.
- LLM/sentiment must never place orders or override stoploss, max open trades, daily loss, drawdown kill switch, or position caps.
- Carry module and FreqAI stay off unless explicitly enabled in config/env.
- Kill switch clear requires operator ack `RESET_KILL_SWITCH`.
- Default exchange path is Bybit Demo / dry_run.
- When uncertain, fail closed (block entry) and log guidance.
